WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Homemade Mac & Cheese. 70 min · 8 servings · American

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Ingredients: 4. 16 oz (1 lb) Tillamook cheese, cubed; 2 cups milk; 3 tablespoons cold butter, cubed; 2 cups uncooked elbow pasta (equals 4 cups cooked)

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 1. Preheat oven to 350°F and grease a 9x13 baking dish.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Step 2. Cook pasta according to box directions. Drain pasta in a colander when done.

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Step 3. Meanwhile, cut cheese and butter into cubes.

6
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Step 4. Layer half of the cooked pasta, cheese, butter, then milk in the baking dish.

7
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Step 5. Repeat with remaining ingredients.

8
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Step 6. Cover with foil and cook for 50–60 min.

9
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Step 7. Uncover the last 10 min to brown the top of the cheese.

10
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.000
You're ready. Use Make It for checkboxes on the page.
